{"id":"000VFM","title":"The Adventures of LMDemasi: Episode 01 - VFM","author":"aqjhs","solvedCount":9,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00","posted":"Gestern, 01:21 Uhr","rules":"LMDemasi is planning a prank for ThePedallingPianist and he needs your help to gather some vintage fax machines for it. Can't wait to see what he does with them.\n\n•\nNormal sudoku rules apply, a must have.\n\n•\nThe task:\n\n• Help LMDemasi by drawing an orthogonal path from him (r2c7) to ThePedallingPianist (r9c9).\n\n• The path can't touch itself, not even diagonally, but well... making a right turn could be considered as diagonally touching but that is not what we mean. We could say a cell on the path can only share an edge with the cells before and after itself, if any, and it can only share a vertex with cells up to two steps in either direction... But even that description allows for some degenerate cases... I don't know anymore, but you do, do you? Please, help!\n\n• The path must pass through all vintage fax machines but I don't know what does he want them for, they don't even work properly.\n\n• Box borders split the path into connected components with the same sum, that's how LMDemasi rslls.\n\n•\nVintage fax machines produce copies slightly altered: the digits on either side of a vintage fax machine differ by exactly 1.\n\n•\nTo help LMDemasi pull this prank off, Marty brought some of his stuff, but it doesn't mean LMDemasi has to pick it up:\n\n• Sensors have a digit equal to the number of cells visited by LMDemasi in the 3x3 region centered at the sensor.\n\n• Pears sit between two digits of the same parity.\n\nOnline in Sudokupad\n\nSee also:\n\n• demasiados bichos\n\n• a hot summer nightmare\n\n• vestiges of an epicyclic castle with DubiousMobius\n\n• for whom the bell jingles\n\n• the three utilities problem","solutionCode":"Digits off the path in column 7, top to bottom.","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki Pairs (Variante)","Region Sum Lines (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/f7cdh4ghkf","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"link":"https://sudokupad.app/f7cdh4ghkf","linkKind":"sudokupad","attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-17T20:41:39+00:00","settings":{},"summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]}}